1
00:00:00,821 --> 00:00:03,281
(Leonard:)...but it turns out
he's a black-diamond skier...

2
00:00:03,448 --> 00:00:06,538
(Leonard:)...he collects vintage motorcycles,
he plays in a rock band.

3
00:00:06,994 --> 00:00:10,414
- So? We're in a rock band.
- No.

4
00:00:10,914 --> 00:00:13,874
We play "Rock Band" on our Xbox.

5
00:00:14,459 --> 00:00:17,959
(Sheldon:)Nice motivational speech
from our lead guitarist.

6
00:00:18,130 --> 00:00:19,170
(Leonard:)He's funny too.

7
00:00:19,339 --> 00:00:24,009
(Leonard:)He does this hysterical impersonation
of Stephen Hawking having phone sex.

8
00:00:24,886 --> 00:00:27,386
[AS STEPHEN HAWKING]
What are you wearing?

9
00:00:28,724 --> 00:00:30,894
[IN NORMAL VOICE]
That's not... He does it better.

10
00:00:31,059 --> 00:00:35,479
(Leonard:)He said he was gonna take me to the gym
so I'm gonna go practice my sit-ups.

11
00:00:36,565 --> 00:00:39,565
Wow. Humongous man crush, dude.

12
00:00:39,901 --> 00:00:41,941
Yup, it's officially a bromance.

13
00:00:42,112 --> 00:00:43,282
[KNOCKING ON DOOR]

14
00:00:44,114 --> 00:00:46,574
(Penny(entering):)Hey, Sheldon. Are you and Leonard
putting up a Christmas tree?

15
00:00:46,742 --> 00:00:50,782
(Sheldon:)No, because we don't celebrate
the ancient pagan festival of Saturnalia.

16
00:00:52,247 --> 00:00:53,417
(Penny:)Saturnalia?

17
00:00:53,582 --> 00:01:00,022
Gather around, kids. It's time for Sheldon's
beloved Christmas special.

